{"strongs": "H1197", "word": "בָּעַר", "translit": "ba.ar", "root": "בער", "morph": "H:V", "pos": "verb", "gloss": "burn, consume", "definition": "I. [ בָּעַר ] verb burn, consume ( ᵑ7 בְּעַר burn ; seek out, collect, glean ; this apparently earlier meaning) — Qal Perfect 3 feminine singular בָּֽעֲרָה Num 11:3 + 2 t., וּבָֽעֲרָה consecutive Isa 10:17 + 3 t., בָּֽעֲרוּ Judg 15:14 + 2 t. + 2Sam 22:13 (but compare De on Ps 18 ), וּבָֽעֲרוּ consecutive Isa 1:31 Imperfect יִבְעַר Exod 3:3 ; Ps 2:12 , etc.; Participle בֹּעֵר Exod 3:2 + 6 t., בֹּעֵרָ֑ה Isa 34:9 , בּוֺעֵ֫רָה Hos 7:4 , בֹּעֲרָ֫ה Isa 30:33 , בֹּעֶ֫רֶת Jer 20:9 , בֹּעֲרוֺת Ezek 1:13 — burn , 1. (intransitive) specifically begin to burn, be kindled Ps 18:8 followed by מִן (subject גֶּחָלִים ) = 2Sam 22:9 (in v 2Sam 22:13 textual error compare above), Ps 106:18 (subject אֵשׁ ); figurative Ps 2:12 (subject אַפּוֺ ) compare Jer 44:6 (subject חֵמָה ); Isa 30:33 (with בְּ , subject ׳ נִשְׁמַת י ), Ps 39:4 (subject אֵשׁ figurative of grief, distress) compare Jer 20:9 . 2. be burning, burn , Judg 15:14 (subject פִּשְׁתִּים , with בָּאֵשׁ ), Exod 3:2 ( הסנה , with בָּאֵשׁ ), v Exod 3:3 (subject id. ); Deut 4:11 ; Deut 5:20 ; Deut 9:15 (all subject הר , with בָּאֵשׁ ), compare Isa 34:9 ( זֶפֶת בערה ), figurative of destruction Isa 1:31 (subject חָסֹן & פֹּעֲלוֺ ); of torch לַפִּיד Isa 62:1 of oven תַּנּוּר Hos 7:4 ; Hos 7:6 (i.e. heated by fire within it). 3. transitive burn, consume (subject אשׁ , להבה etc., followed by בְּ ) Num 11:1 ; Num 11:3 ( ׳ אשׁ י ), Job 1:16 ( אשׁ אלהים ); in smile Ezek 1:33 ( ׳ גחלי אשׁ י ), Ps 83:15 (only here transitive with accusative; should תבער be pointed as Pi`el ?); figurative (subject wrath of ׳ י ) Isa 42:25 compare Lam 2:5 (subject fire = fiery trial) Isa 43:2 . 4. active but absolute, figurative, subject wrath of ׳ י Jer 4:4 ; Jer 7:20 ; Jer 21:12 ; Ps 89:47 compare Isa 10:17 ; Ps 79:5 ; Isa 30:27 ( ֗֗֗ בֹּעֵר אַפּוֺ ׳ שֵׁם י ) Mal 3:19 ( היום בא ); of human anger Esth 1:12 subject wickedness Isa 9:17 . Pi`el Perfect בִּעֵר 1Kgs 22:47 ; 2Kgs 23:24 , וּבִעֵר consecutive Lev 6:5 , בִּעַ֫רְתָּ 2Chr 19:3 , וּבִַ ערְתָּ֫ Deut 13:6 + 9 t. in Deuteronomy; וּבִעֲרוּ consecutive Ezek 39:9 (twice in verse) (9:a strike out Co after Vrss ), etc.; Imperfect יְבַעֵר 1Kgs 14:10 2 masculine singular תְּבַעֵר Deut 21:9 , יְבַעֲרוּ Ezek 39:10 2 masculine plural תְּבַעֲרוּ Exod 35:3 , וּנְבַעֲרָ֫ה subordinate Judg 20:13 Participle מְבַעֲרִים Jer 7:18 — 1. kindle , literal with accusative אשׁ Exod 35:3 ; Jer 7:18 compare Ezek 39:9 (see above) v Ezek 39:10 figurative of ׳ י sending destruction Ezek 21:4 compare of human schemes Isa 50:11 light , object lamps in temple 2Chr 4:20 compare 2Chr 13:11 . 2. burn , literal with accusative עֵצִים Lev 6:5 , גָּלָל dung 1Kgs 14:10 absolute Isa 44:15 compare Isa 40:16 ; Neh 10:35 . 3. figurative consume , utterly remove, particular of evil and guilt, with accusative, especially in Deuteronomic phrase ובערת הרע מקרבך (מישׂראלׅ Deut 13:6 ; Deut 17:7 ; Deut 17:12 ; Deut 19:13 ; Deut 19:19 ; Deut 21:21 compare v Deut 21:9 ; Deut 22:21 ; Deut 22:22 ; Deut 22:24 ; Deut 24:7 , see also Judg 20:13 further, 1Kgs 22:47 ; 2Kgs 23:24 ; 2Chr 19:3 also of devoted (tabooed) things Deut 26:13 ; Deut 26:14 of persons ( exterminate ) 2Sam 4:11 followed by אחרי pregnantly 1Kgs 14:10 ; 1Kgs 21:21 = devour, devastate, greedily enjoy the fruits of, Isa 3:14 absolute היה לְבָעֵר be for destruction, be destroyed Num 24:22 ; Isa 5:5 ; Isa 6:13 compare רוּחַ בָּעֵר Isa 4:4 . Pu`al Participle מְבֹעָ֑רֶת Jer 36:22 — burn (i.e. be supplied with fire), of fire-jar, הָאָח . Hiph`il Perfect וְהִבְעַרְתִּ֫י Nah 2:14 Imperfect וַיַּבְעֵר Judg 15:5 ; 2Chr 28:3 , וַיַּבְעֶרֿ Judg 15:5 תַּבְעִיר Ezek 5:2 Participle מַבְעִיר 1Kgs 16:3 , מַבְעִר Exod 22:5 — 1. kindle (with accusative of congnate meaning with verb) Exod 22:5 , compare Judg 15:5 אשׁ בלפידים ׳ ויב caused fire to burn among the brands. 2. burn up , with accusative Judg 15:5 ; 2Chr 28:3 (sacrifice of children בָּאֵשׁ ) Ezek 5:2 ( בָּאוּר but compare Co ) Nah 2:14 ( בעשׁן ). 3. consume = destroy (compare Pi`el) 1Kgs 16:3 (followed by אַחֲרֵי ).", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB1237')\">BDB1237</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H1197')\">H1197</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB1236')\">BDB1236</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB1238')\">BDB1238</entry></div><p> I. [<bdbheb>בָּעַר</bdbheb>] <b>verb</b> <highlightword>burn, consume</highlightword> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Tg')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵑ7</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <bdbheb>בְּעַר</bdbheb> <highlight>burn</highlight>; <placeholder654/> <highlight>seek out, collect, glean</highlight>; this apparently earlier meaning) — <div class=\"point\"><b>Qal</b> <highlight>Perfect</highlight> 3 feminine singular <bdbheb>בָּֽעֲרָה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Num 11:3\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(4,11,3)\">Num 11:3</ref> + 2 t., <bdbheb>וּבָֽעֲרָה</bdbheb> consecutive <ref ref=\"Isa 10:17\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(23,10,17)\">Isa 10:17</ref> + 3 t., <bdbheb>בָּֽעֲרוּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Judg 15:14\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(7,15,14)\">Judg 15:14</ref> + 2 t. + <ref ref=\"2Sam 22:13\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(10,22,13)\">2Sam 22:13</ref> (but compare <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('De')\">De</lookup> on <ref ref=\"Ps 18\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"200\" onclick=\"bcv(19,18,1)\">Ps 18</ref>), <bdbheb>וּבָֽעֲרוּ</bdbheb> consecutive <ref ref=\"Isa 1:31\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"31\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"31\" onclick=\"bcv(23,1,31)\">Isa 1:31</ref> <highlight>Imperfect</highlight> <bdbheb>יִבְעַר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 3:3\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(2,3,3)\">Exod 3:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 2:12\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(19,2,12)\">Ps 2:12</ref>, etc.; <highlight>Participle</highlight> <bdbheb>בֹּעֵר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 3:2\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(2,3,2)\">Exod 3:2</ref> + 6 t., <bdbheb>בֹּעֵרָ֑ה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 34:9\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"34\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"34\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(23,34,9)\">Isa 34:9</ref>, <bdbheb>בּוֺעֵ֫רָה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Hos 7:4\" b=\"28\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(28,7,4)\">Hos 7:4</ref>, <bdbheb>בֹּעֲרָ֫ה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 30:33\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"33\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"33\" onclick=\"bcv(23,30,33)\">Isa 30:33</ref>, <bdbheb>בֹּעֶ֫רֶת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 20:9\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(24,20,9)\">Jer 20:9</ref>, <bdbheb>בֹּעֲרוֺת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 1:13\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(26,1,13)\">Ezek 1:13</ref> — <highlight>burn</highlight>, </div><div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> (intransitive) specifically <highlight>begin to burn, be kindled</highlight> <ref ref=\"Ps 18:8\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(19,18,8)\">Ps 18:8</ref> followed by <bdbheb>מִן</bdbheb> (subject <bdbheb>גֶּחָלִים</bdbheb>) = <ref ref=\"2Sam 22:9\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(10,22,9)\">2Sam 22:9</ref> (in v<ref ref=\"2Sam 22:13\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(10,22,13)\">2Sam 22:13</ref> textual error compare above), <ref ref=\"Ps 106:18\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"106\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"106\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(19,106,18)\">Ps 106:18</ref> (subject <bdbheb>אֵשׁ</bdbheb>); figurative <ref ref=\"Ps 2:12\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(19,2,12)\">Ps 2:12</ref> (subject <bdbheb>אַפּוֺ</bdbheb>) compare <ref ref=\"Jer 44:6\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"44\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"44\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(24,44,6)\">Jer 44:6</ref> (subject <bdbheb>חֵמָה</bdbheb>); <ref ref=\"Isa 30:33\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"33\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"33\" onclick=\"bcv(23,30,33)\">Isa 30:33</ref> (with <bdbheb>בְּ</bdbheb>, subject <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>נִשְׁמַת י</bdbheb>), <ref ref=\"Ps 39:4\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"39\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"39\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(19,39,4)\">Ps 39:4</ref> (subject <bdbheb>אֵשׁ</bdbheb> figurative of grief, distress) compare <ref ref=\"Jer 20:9\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(24,20,9)\">Jer 20:9</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> <highlight>be burning, burn</highlight>, <ref ref=\"Judg 15:14\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(7,15,14)\">Judg 15:14</ref> (subject <bdbheb>פִּשְׁתִּים</bdbheb>, with <bdbheb>בָּאֵשׁ</bdbheb>), <ref ref=\"Exod 3:2\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(2,3,2)\">Exod 3:2</ref> (<bdbheb>הסנה</bdbheb>, with <bdbheb>בָּאֵשׁ</bdbheb>), v<ref ref=\"Exod 3:3\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(2,3,3)\">Exod 3:3</ref> (subject <highlight>id.</highlight>); <ref ref=\"Deut 4:11\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(5,4,11)\">Deut 4:11</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 5:20\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(5,5,20)\">Deut 5:20</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 9:15\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(5,9,15)\">Deut 9:15</ref> (all subject <bdbheb>הר</bdbheb>, with <bdbheb>בָּאֵשׁ</bdbheb>), compare <ref ref=\"Isa 34:9\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"34\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"34\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(23,34,9)\">Isa 34:9</ref> (<bdbheb>זֶפֶת בערה</bdbheb>), figurative of destruction <ref ref=\"Isa 1:31\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"31\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"31\" onclick=\"bcv(23,1,31)\">Isa 1:31</ref> (subject <bdbheb>חָסֹן</bdbheb> &amp; <bdbheb>פֹּעֲלוֺ</bdbheb>); of torch <bdbheb>לַפִּיד</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 62:1\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"62\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"62\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(23,62,1)\">Isa 62:1</ref> of oven <bdbheb>תַּנּוּר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Hos 7:4\" b=\"28\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(28,7,4)\">Hos 7:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"Hos 7:6\" b=\"28\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(28,7,6)\">Hos 7:6</ref> (i.e. heated by fire within it). </div><div class=\"point\"><b>3.</b> transitive <highlight>burn, consume</highlight> (subject <bdbheb>אשׁ</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>להבה</bdbheb> etc., followed by <bdbheb>בְּ</bdbheb>) <ref ref=\"Num 11:1\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(4,11,1)\">Num 11:1</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 11:3\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(4,11,3)\">Num 11:3</ref> (<bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>אשׁ י</bdbheb>), <ref ref=\"Job 1:16\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(18,1,16)\">Job 1:16</ref> (<bdbheb>אשׁ אלהים</bdbheb>); in smile <checkingNeeded/><ref ref=\"Ezek 1:33\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"33\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"33\" onclick=\"bcv(26,1,33)\">Ezek 1:33</ref> (<bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>גחלי אשׁ י</bdbheb>), <ref ref=\"Ps 83:15\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"83\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"83\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(19,83,15)\">Ps 83:15</ref> (only here transitive with accusative; should <bdbheb>תבער</bdbheb> be pointed as Pi`el ?); figurative (subject wrath of <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb>) <ref ref=\"Isa 42:25\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"42\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"42\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(23,42,25)\">Isa 42:25</ref> compare <ref ref=\"Lam 2:5\" b=\"25\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(25,2,5)\">Lam 2:5</ref> (subject fire = fiery trial) <ref ref=\"Isa 43:2\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"43\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"43\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(23,43,2)\">Isa 43:2</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>4.</b> active but absolute, figurative, subject wrath of <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 4:4\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(24,4,4)\">Jer 4:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 7:20\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(24,7,20)\">Jer 7:20</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 21:12\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(24,21,12)\">Jer 21:12</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 89:47\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"89\" vBegin=\"47\" cEnd=\"89\" vEnd=\"47\" onclick=\"bcv(19,89,47)\">Ps 89:47</ref> compare <ref ref=\"Isa 10:17\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(23,10,17)\">Isa 10:17</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 79:5\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"79\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"79\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(19,79,5)\">Ps 79:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 30:27\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(23,30,27)\">Isa 30:27</ref> (<bdbheb>֗֗֗ בֹּעֵר אַפּוֺ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>שֵׁם י</bdbheb>) <ref ref=\"Mal 3:19\" b=\"39\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(39,3,19)\">Mal 3:19</ref> (<bdbheb>היום בא</bdbheb>); of human anger <ref ref=\"Esth 1:12\" b=\"17\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(17,1,12)\">Esth 1:12</ref> subject wickedness <ref ref=\"Isa 9:17\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(23,9,17)\">Isa 9:17</ref>. <b>Pi`el</b> <highlight>Perfect</highlight> <bdbheb>בִּעֵר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Kgs 22:47\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"47\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"47\" onclick=\"bcv(11,22,47)\">1Kgs 22:47</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 23:24\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(12,23,24)\">2Kgs 23:24</ref>, <bdbheb>וּבִעֵר</bdbheb> consecutive <ref ref=\"Lev 6:5\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(3,6,5)\">Lev 6:5</ref>, <bdbheb>בִּעַ֫רְתָּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Chr 19:3\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(14,19,3)\">2Chr 19:3</ref>, <bdbheb>וּבִַ ערְתָּ֫</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 13:6\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(5,13,6)\">Deut 13:6</ref> + 9 t. in Deuteronomy; <bdbheb>וּבִעֲרוּ</bdbheb> consecutive <ref ref=\"Ezek 39:9\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"39\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"39\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(26,39,9)\">Ezek 39:9</ref> (twice in verse) (9:a strike out <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Co')\">Co</lookup> after <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Vrss')\"><reflink>Vrss</reflink></lookup>), etc.; <highlight>Imperfect</highlight> <bdbheb>יְבַעֵר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Kgs 14:10\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(11,14,10)\">1Kgs 14:10</ref> 2 masculine singular <bdbheb>תְּבַעֵר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 21:9\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(5,21,9)\">Deut 21:9</ref>, <bdbheb>יְבַעֲרוּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 39:10\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"39\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"39\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(26,39,10)\">Ezek 39:10</ref> 2 masculine plural <bdbheb>תְּבַעֲרוּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 35:3\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"35\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"35\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(2,35,3)\">Exod 35:3</ref>, <bdbheb>וּנְבַעֲרָ֫ה</bdbheb> subordinate <ref ref=\"Judg 20:13\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(7,20,13)\">Judg 20:13</ref> <highlight>Participle</highlight> <bdbheb>מְבַעֲרִים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 7:18\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(24,7,18)\">Jer 7:18</ref> — </div><div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> <highlight>kindle</highlight>, literal with accusative <bdbheb>אשׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 35:3\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"35\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"35\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(2,35,3)\">Exod 35:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 7:18\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(24,7,18)\">Jer 7:18</ref> compare <ref ref=\"Ezek 39:9\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"39\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"39\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(26,39,9)\">Ezek 39:9</ref> (see above) v<ref ref=\"Ezek 39:10\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"39\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"39\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(26,39,10)\">Ezek 39:10</ref> figurative of <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb> sending destruction <ref ref=\"Ezek 21:4\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(26,21,4)\">Ezek 21:4</ref> compare of human schemes <ref ref=\"Isa 50:11\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"50\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"50\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(23,50,11)\">Isa 50:11</ref> <highlight>light</highlight>, object lamps in temple <ref ref=\"2Chr 4:20\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(14,4,20)\">2Chr 4:20</ref> compare <ref ref=\"2Chr 13:11\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(14,13,11)\">2Chr 13:11</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> <highlight>burn</highlight>, literal with accusative <bdbheb>עֵצִים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Lev 6:5\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(3,6,5)\">Lev 6:5</ref>, <bdbheb>גָּלָל</bdbheb> <highlight>dung</highlight> <ref ref=\"1Kgs 14:10\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(11,14,10)\">1Kgs 14:10</ref> absolute <ref ref=\"Isa 44:15\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"44\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"44\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(23,44,15)\">Isa 44:15</ref> compare <ref ref=\"Isa 40:16\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"40\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"40\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(23,40,16)\">Isa 40:16</ref>; <ref ref=\"Neh 10:35\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"35\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"35\" onclick=\"bcv(16,10,35)\">Neh 10:35</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>3.</b> figurative <highlight>consume</highlight>, utterly remove, particular of evil and guilt, with accusative, especially in Deuteronomic phrase <bdbheb>ובערת הרע מקרבך (מישׂראלׅ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 13:6\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(5,13,6)\">Deut 13:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 17:7\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(5,17,7)\">Deut 17:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 17:12\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(5,17,12)\">Deut 17:12</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 19:13\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(5,19,13)\">Deut 19:13</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 19:19\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(5,19,19)\">Deut 19:19</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 21:21\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(5,21,21)\">Deut 21:21</ref> compare v<ref ref=\"Deut 21:9\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(5,21,9)\">Deut 21:9</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 22:21\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(5,22,21)\">Deut 22:21</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 22:22\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(5,22,22)\">Deut 22:22</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 22:24\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(5,22,24)\">Deut 22:24</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 24:7\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(5,24,7)\">Deut 24:7</ref>, see also <ref ref=\"Judg 20:13\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(7,20,13)\">Judg 20:13</ref> further, <ref ref=\"1Kgs 22:47\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"47\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"47\" onclick=\"bcv(11,22,47)\">1Kgs 22:47</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 23:24\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(12,23,24)\">2Kgs 23:24</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Chr 19:3\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(14,19,3)\">2Chr 19:3</ref> also of devoted (tabooed) things <ref ref=\"Deut 26:13\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(5,26,13)\">Deut 26:13</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 26:14\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(5,26,14)\">Deut 26:14</ref> of persons (<highlight>exterminate</highlight>) <ref ref=\"2Sam 4:11\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(10,4,11)\">2Sam 4:11</ref> followed by <bdbheb>אחרי</bdbheb> pregnantly <ref ref=\"1Kgs 14:10\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(11,14,10)\">1Kgs 14:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Kgs 21:21\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(11,21,21)\">1Kgs 21:21</ref> = devour, devastate, greedily enjoy the fruits of, <ref ref=\"Isa 3:14\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(23,3,14)\">Isa 3:14</ref> absolute <bdbheb>היה לְבָעֵר</bdbheb> <highlight>be for destruction, be destroyed</highlight> <ref ref=\"Num 24:22\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(4,24,22)\">Num 24:22</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 5:5\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(23,5,5)\">Isa 5:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 6:13\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(23,6,13)\">Isa 6:13</ref> compare <bdbheb>רוּחַ בָּעֵר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 4:4\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(23,4,4)\">Isa 4:4</ref>. <b>Pu`al</b> <highlight>Participle</highlight> <bdbheb>מְבֹעָ֑רֶת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 36:22\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"36\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"36\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(24,36,22)\">Jer 36:22</ref> — <highlight>burn</highlight> (i.e. be supplied with fire), of fire-jar, <bdbheb>הָאָח</bdbheb>. <b>Hiph`il</b> <highlight>Perfect</highlight> <bdbheb>וְהִבְעַרְתִּ֫י</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Nah 2:14\" b=\"34\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(34,2,14)\">Nah 2:14</ref> <highlight>Imperfect</highlight> <bdbheb>וַיַּבְעֵר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Judg 15:5\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(7,15,5)\">Judg 15:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Chr 28:3\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(14,28,3)\">2Chr 28:3</ref>, <bdbheb>וַיַּבְעֶרֿ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Judg 15:5\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(7,15,5)\">Judg 15:5</ref> <bdbheb>תַּבְעִיר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 5:2\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(26,5,2)\">Ezek 5:2</ref> <highlight>Participle</highlight> <bdbheb>מַבְעִיר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Kgs 16:3\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(11,16,3)\">1Kgs 16:3</ref>, <bdbheb>מַבְעִר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 22:5\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(2,22,5)\">Exod 22:5</ref> — </div><div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> <highlight>kindle</highlight> (with accusative of congnate meaning with verb) <ref ref=\"Exod 22:5\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(2,22,5)\">Exod 22:5</ref>, compare <ref ref=\"Judg 15:5\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(7,15,5)\">Judg 15:5</ref> <bdbheb>אשׁ בלפידים</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ויב</bdbheb> <highlight>caused fire to burn among the brands.</highlight> </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> <highlight>burn up</highlight>, with accusative <ref ref=\"Judg 15:5\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(7,15,5)\">Judg 15:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Chr 28:3\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(14,28,3)\">2Chr 28:3</ref> (sacrifice of children <bdbheb>בָּאֵשׁ</bdbheb>) <ref ref=\"Ezek 5:2\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(26,5,2)\">Ezek 5:2</ref> (<bdbheb>בָּאוּר</bdbheb> but compare <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Co')\">Co</lookup>) <ref ref=\"Nah 2:14\" b=\"34\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(34,2,14)\">Nah 2:14</ref> (<bdbheb>בעשׁן</bdbheb>). </div><div class=\"point\"><b>3.</b> <highlight>consume</highlight> = <highlight>destroy</highlight> (compare Pi`el) <ref ref=\"1Kgs 16:3\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(11,16,3)\">1Kgs 16:3</ref> (followed by <bdbheb>אַחֲרֵי</bdbheb>). </p></div><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Num 11:3", "book": "NUM", "chapter": 11, "verse": 3}, {"raw": "Isa 10:17", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 10, "verse": 17}, {"raw": "Judg 15:14", "book": "JDG", "chapter": 15, "verse": 14}, {"raw": "2Sam 22:13", "book": "2SA", "chapter": 22, "verse": 13}, {"raw": "Ps 18", "book": "PSA", "chapter": 18, "verse": 1, "chapterEnd": 18, "verseEnd": 200}, {"raw": "Isa 1:31", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 1, "verse": 31}, {"raw": "Exod 3:3", "book": "EXO", "chapter": 3, "verse": 3}, {"raw": "Ps 2:12", "book": "PSA", "chapter": 2, "verse": 12}, {"raw": "Exod 3:2", "book": "EXO", "chapter": 3, "verse": 2}, {"raw": "Isa 34:9", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 34, "verse": 9}, {"raw": "Hos 7:4", "book": "HOS", "chapter": 7, "verse": 4}, {"raw": "Isa 30:33", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 30, "verse": 33}, {"raw": "Jer 20:9", "book": "JER", "chapter": 20, "verse": 9}, {"raw": "Ezek 1:13", "book": "EZK", "chapter": 1, "verse": 13}, {"raw": "Ps 18:8", "book": "PSA", "chapter": 18, "verse": 8}, {"raw": "2Sam 22:9", "book": "2SA", "chapter": 22, "verse": 9}, {"raw": "Ps 106:18", "book": "PSA", "chapter": 106, "verse": 18}, {"raw": "Jer 44:6", "book": "JER", "chapter": 44, "verse": 6}, {"raw": "Ps 39:4", "book": "PSA", "chapter": 39, "verse": 4}, {"raw": "Deut 4:11", "book": "DEU", "chapter": 4, "verse": 11}, {"raw": "Deut 5:20", "book": "DEU", "chapter": 5, "verse": 20}, {"raw": "Deut 9:15", "book": "DEU", "chapter": 9, "verse": 15}, {"raw": "Isa 62:1", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 62, "verse": 1}, {"raw": "Hos 7:6", "book": "HOS", "chapter": 7, "verse": 6}, {"raw": "Num 11:1", "book": "NUM", 